# The OUYA branch's denser fog (wish of the project owner, 14.11.2026, port/docs/ouya-machbarkeit.md): with a shorter view
# distance (patch 0223, runtime/view_distance.cpp) the game left out houses and figures beyond its far plane
# (fog end * (1 - LightEnv.far_play_ratio) + 1) while the fog there was still thin: one saw the bare ground where they
# stood. cLightMgr::setFog and hokanMove now give GX a fog that ends at that far plane (re4_view_fog_dense: start and end
# scaled alike; not nearer than 6 m, the least end of patch 0223), only while the view distance is below 100 %; the far plane stays as patch 0223 sets it. At 100 %: as the
# game.
